# keep fw/silicon_bringup/out/silicon_bringup.hex tracked (golden artifact)
# FW-C3 fix（2026-05-02 audit）：boot_rom mask ROM 是流片对象，必须有 SHA 溯源。
# git 不支持先 exclude 父目录再 re-include 子文件，所以用 file-pattern：
# boot_rom/out/ 下中间产物（.elf/.o/.map/.dump）忽略，golden .bin/.hex track。
fw/boot_rom/out/*.elf
fw/boot_rom/out/*.o
fw/boot_rom/out/*.map
fw/boot_rom/out/*.dump
# audit-pass3 (W-1b): chip_top_rom_smoke / chip_top_rom_hi_smoke TB 的现场
# build firmware（每次 sim 重 build），不是流片对象，全部忽略。
fw/boot_rom/out/rom_smoke_*
fw/boot_rom/out/rom_hi_smoke_*
fw/out/
eassy-prompt/
scripts/_patch_paper.py
iter_*_CongestedCLBsAndNets.txt
